            {
                "drawing_id": "cdff11bf-b727-49d6-91ae-bfad04d0aa12",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"228\" height=\"94\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">            OSPF Optimization\n\n\ud83d\udd38 Virtual Links\n\ud83d\udd38 Summarization &amp; Area Filtering\n\ud83d\udd38 IP Prefix Lists</text></svg>",
                "x": 172,
                "y": -243,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "bf453b00-486f-4e24-b522-def9f413ac83",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"233\" height=\"99\"><rect width=\"233\" height=\"99\" fill=\"#aaff7f\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"#000000\" /></svg>",
                "x": 171,
                "y": -244,
                "z": 1
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "1035ca0c-1051-4bb1-93d1-08781c701ae2",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"480\" height=\"184\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">R1#show ip ospf virtual-links\nVirtual Link OSPF_VL0 to router 2.2.2.2 is up\n\nR1#show ip ospf neighbor\nNeighbor ID     Pri   State           Dead Time   Address         Interface\n2.2.2.2           1   FULL/BDR        00:00:33    10.0.12.2       FastEthernet0/1\n\nR1#show ip route ospf\n     10.0.0.0/24 is subnetted, 2 subnets\nO IA    10.0.23.0 [110/11] via 10.0.12.2, 00:35:01, FastEthernet0/1\nO IA 192.168.2.0/24 [110/21] via 10.0.12.2, 00:32:50, FastEthernet0/1</text></svg>",
                "x": -651,
                "y": -271,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "d58fb7e2-4a68-49b8-b67d-cbdc975c89ca",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"480\" height=\"216\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">R2#show ip ospf virtual-links\nVirtual Link OSPF_VL1 to router 3.3.3.3 is up\nVirtual Link OSPF_VL0 to router 1.1.1.1 is down\n\nR2#show ip ospf neighbor\nNeighbor ID     Pri   State           Dead Time   Address         Interface\n3.3.3.3           0   FULL/  -           -        10.0.23.3       OSPF_VL1\n1.1.1.1           1   FULL/DR         00:00:39    10.0.12.1       FastEthernet0/1\n3.3.3.3           1   FULL/BDR        00:00:39    10.0.23.3       FastEthernet1/0\n\nR2#show ip route ospf\nO    192.168.1.0/24 [110/20] via 10.0.12.1, 00:36:40, FastEthernet0/1\nO    192.168.2.0/24 [110/11] via 10.0.23.3, 00:35:35, FastEthernet1/0</text></svg>",
                "x": -651,
                "y": -66,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "5f07f560-7cbc-4d30-8583-5dd211d07fde",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"476\" height=\"200\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">R3#show ip ospf virtual-links\nVirtual Link OSPF_VL0 to router 2.2.2.2 is up\n\nR3#show ip ospf  neighbor\nNeighbor ID     Pri   State           Dead Time   Address         Interface\n2.2.2.2           0   FULL/  -           -        10.0.23.2       OSPF_VL0\n2.2.2.2           1   FULL/DR         00:00:38    10.0.23.2       FastEthernet1/0\n\nR3#show ip route ospf\n     10.0.0.0/24 is subnetted, 2 subnets\nO       10.0.12.0 [110/11] via 10.0.23.2, 00:37:04, FastEthernet1/0\nO    192.168.1.0/24 [110/21] via 10.0.23.2, 00:37:04, FastEthernet1/0</text></svg>",
                "x": -652,
                "y": 166,
                "z": 2
