                "svg": "<svg width=\"417\" height=\"104\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">PC1&gt; ping 192.168.2.2\n84 bytes from 192.168.2.2 icmp_seq=1 ttl=61 time=92.498 ms\n84 bytes from 192.168.2.2 icmp_seq=2 ttl=61 time=80.456 ms\n84 bytes from 192.168.2.2 icmp_seq=3 ttl=61 time=91.996 ms\n84 bytes from 192.168.2.2 icmp_seq=4 ttl=61 time=92.111 ms\n84 bytes from 192.168.2.2 icmp_seq=5 ttl=61 time=92.632 ms</text></svg>",
